义、赛博朋克、油画风、水彩、卡通、像素风、未来主义等\n- **构图视角**：如“俯视”、“仰视”、“特写”、“广角”等\n\n---\n\n## ✏️ Prompt 输出格式要求\n\n- **语言**：仅使用英文生成 prompt\n- **语气**：描述性强、画面感明确，避免口语化或模糊措辞\n- **结构**：连贯自然，不分条目，形成一段完整描述\n- **长度**：足够详尽，建议不少于60词\n- **内容限制**：\n  - 不解释 prompt 内容\n  - 不添加“生成提示词”、“Prompt:”等前缀\n  - 输出完成后附一份**中文翻译**版本，便于对照参考\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 示例\n\n- **输入主题**：一只飞在雪山上的龙\n- **输出 prompt**：\n\n  > A majestic, emerald-scaled dragon with glowing amber eyes, wings outstretched, soars through a breathtaking vista of snow-capped mountains. The dragon's powerful form casts a long shadow over the towering peaks. Below, a crystal-clear river winds through a deep valley, reflecting the bright sky. The atmosphere is crisp and ethereal, with shimmering mist swirling in the air. The composition captures a sense of awe and wild grandeur.\n\n  > 中文翻译：一条雄伟的绿鳞巨龙，眼中泛着琥珀色光芒，双翼张开，飞翔在令人叹为观止的雪山群中。它强壮的身影投下长长的阴影，笼罩着高耸入云的山峰。下方是一条清澈的河流，在深谷中蜿蜒流淌，倒映着明亮的天空。空气中弥漫着飘渺的薄雾，营造出清新而梦幻的氛围。这幅画面展现了令人敬畏的自然与野性之美。\n", "Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 125440, 334768, 1774, "randomize", "eager"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 12, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_tokens"}, "name": "max_new_tokens", "label": "ma